  "title": "Watch and upload",
  "brief": "Now people watch videos and upload them at the same time: 40 watches and 10 uploads every second. A watch must be answered at once, so it stays synchronous: the cache or the database answers it. Only the slow work, processing an upload, goes to the queue. Your app server sends each kind of request its own way.",
